  "content": "<h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#b96ad9\"><strong>这是罗夫尔重制的《阴影中人》。</strong></span></h1>\n<p><br><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">英文：</span><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">这个模组的设计初衷就是为了让你发笑，它添加各种有趣的图片和声音。</span><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">这并不否认尖叫者仍然是尖叫者，而且除了能让玩家发笑外，它们也能吓人。想象一下，你在森林中行走，突然有个人带着滑稽的声音跳出来，你会怎么想？在新更新中，该模组已完全适配TMFTS的最新版本。该模组试图为恐怖时尚带来一些新元素。</span><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">该模组无意冒犯任何人。</span><br><br><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">俄文：<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> <span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">该模组是对“The Man From The Shadow”模组外部部分的完全重新制作，加入了搞笑、迷因、荒诞和怪异元素。这是一个超级有趣且疯狂的模组，可能会让你笑出声，甚至吓到你。模组中替换了所有声音、尖叫者、纹理、文本等。该模组无意冒犯任何人，且不含禁止词汇，完全符合Twitch友好标准，但可能包含一些不太好的词语。<br><br><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><strong>....不再扭屁股....</strong></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>!!!请务必下载GECKOLIB!!!<br>!!!必须下载GECKOLIB!!!</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span><span><iframe style=\"width:503px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_xegWBvU0-k\" width=\"503\" height=\"294\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;看看这些酷炫的视频！！！<br><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 